### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Pilot profiles
GET http://localhost:5000/pilots

### Device threat model (health pilot)
POST http://localhost:5000/analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_data": {"cpe": "cpe:2.3:o:cisco:ios_xe:16.12.4:*:*:*:*:*:*:*", "deviceName": "Clinical edge router"},
 "pilot": "health", "limit": 3}

### Device threat model by name only (keyword search, noisier)
POST http://localhost:5000/analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_data": {"deviceName": "Eclipse Mosquitto"}, "pilot": "smart_city", "limit": 3}

### Topology analysis for a demo topology (async)
GET http://localhost:5000/topologies/nuclear/analysis?pilot=nuclear&limit=3&async=true

### Poll a job (paste the job_id)
GET http://localhost:5000/jobs/JOB_ID

### Single asset from the mock Risk Assessment service
GET http://localhost:5000/analysis/asset/h-web?pilot=health

### Stored threat models
GET http://localhost:5000/threat-models?limit=5

### CSV export
GET http://localhost:5000/datasets/vulnerabilities?limit=20
